      "reason": "The evidence contains model attributions for PAY_AMT3 (contribution -0.4745, direction decreases_risk) and pay_max (contribution -0.3572, direction decreases_risk). Both are negative log‑odds contributions, i.e., they lower the risk score, matching the claim that they \"contribute to reducing risk\"."
