    {
      "claim_id": "c4",
      "status": "supported",
      "reason": "The derived util_ratio has a value of 0.04406 (4.4 %) and its attribution shows a contribution of -0.2499 with direction decreases_risk, indicating it lowers the risk score, which aligns with the claim that it \"further supports a lower risk assessment\"."
    }
  ],
  "omissions": []
}

{
  "claims": [
    {
      "claim_id": "c3",
      "status": "supported",
      "reason": "The evidence includes model attributions for the derived largest repayment status code (pay_max) with a negative contribution, for PAY_AMT1 (amount paid in September 2005) with a positive contribution, and for BILL_AMT6 (bill amount in April 2005) with a negative contribution. All three are recorded as influencing the model's risk score, matching the claim."
